# 🖱️ Cursor Moving Project

A simple Python project that demonstrates cursor movement using Python. This project was created as a beginner-level programming project to understand how Python can interact with the computer mouse and control cursor movement.

## 📌 About the Project

The **Cursor Moving Project** is a small Python project focused on controlling and moving the mouse cursor programmatically.

The project contains different Python files for experimenting with cursor movement and mouse control.

## ✨ Features

* 🖱️ Controls mouse cursor movement
* 🐍 Built using Python
* 💻 Simple beginner-friendly project
* 🎯 Helps understand mouse automation
* 📚 Useful for learning Python libraries and automation

