## 🚀 How to Run

### 1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/nalintiwari36-coder/cusrsor-moving--project.git
```

### 2. Open the project

Open the project in **VS Code** or **PyCharm**.

### 3. Install the required library

If your Python code uses `pyautogui`, install it using:

```bash
pip install pyautogui
```

### 4. Run the Python file

```bash
python Dragon.cursor.py
```

or

```bash
python Dragon.cursor2.py
```

